{"schema":3,"source_digest":"e8a1fc0bf8e17ed6063bc2bdcc89f87f63e5337030687a50d5a42d66c64c25d7","dependencies":[],"processor_digest":"0e7e287f498782225c86635c4b16151adcc5552dc8a023621b89169c269e3a64","result":{"html":"<html><head></head><body><h1 id=\"finix\">Finix</h1>\n<p>Finix has native <code>sessiond</code> support. Enable it in your system configuration:</p>\n<html><head></head><body><pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-nix\"><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">services</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">sessiond</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">enable</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(209,154,102);\">true</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><br></code></pre></body></html>\n<h2 id=\"pam-integration\">PAM integration</h2>\n<p>The PAM module registers login sessions with <code>sessiond</code>. Enabling the Finix\nmodule normally configures this integration for the standard login service.</p>\n<p>For a custom PAM service, add the session rule explicitly, replacing <code>&lt;name&gt;</code>\nwith the service name:</p>\n<html><head></head><body><pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-nix\"><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">config</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">,</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">lib</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">,</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">...</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">:</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">security</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">pam</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">services</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span>&lt;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">name</span>&gt;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span>text&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">lib</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(97,175,239);\">mkAfter</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">''</span><span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\"></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;session&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;optional&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">${</span><span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">config</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">services</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">sessiond</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">package</span><span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">/lib/security/pam_sessiond.so</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">''</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><br></code></pre></body></html>\n</body></html>","headers":[{"text":"Finix","level":1,"id":"finix"},{"text":"PAM integration","level":2,"id":"pam-integration"}],"title":"Finix","included_files":[]},"frontmatter":null}